The '''Rider of the Deep''' is an {{Rarity|u|nolink=yes}} [[Sea Creatures|Sea Creature]] that can be fished up from Water.
== Spawning ==
The '''Rider of the Deep''' can be caught from [[Water]] upon reaching {{Skill|fishing|XI}}. 

The base [[Sea Creatures#Sea Creature Weight|Weight]] for the '''Rider of the Deep''' is {{Green|400}}, resulting in a default catch chance of {{Chance|9.31%|1|10.74|sea creatures}} with all Sea Creatures unlocked. Currently there are no modifiers that can be used to increase it.

