== Trivia ==
* Prior to version 0.9, the chicken could lay eggs that gave {{skill|Farming}} XP like a normal chicken.
* Prior to a fix<!--fixed by May 4, 2022-->, the Fishing XP from killing the Monster of the Deep counted towards the XP required to spawn Revenants even though the message from starting a [[Zombie Slayer]] quest specifies that Combat XP is required.

